{
  "server": "hubspot",
  "description": "Open deals in the default pipeline: Globex expansion 180,000, Umbrella renewal 95,000 and Hooli pilot 60,500 (335,500), and three open deals with no amount (Cyberdyne rollout, Tyrell renewal, Massive Dynamic). A closed-won 400,000 deal doesn't count. Filling the missing amounts with an average would wrongly pass a 500,000 goal.",
